@title Cables drawer: many proposals scroll, few do not, none say so
@area Cables
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Regression (RM-13): with no cable yet the proposals sat outside any scroll area, so 14 of them pushed the drawer off the window.
# Fixtures: qa/fixtures/cable-proposals-{many,few,none}.novo (built by write_cable_proposal_fixtures).
open qa/fixtures/cable-proposals-many.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+4
wait 10
expect "Proposed cables"
expect "=A1-W1"
shot cables-many-top
check_layout
check_blank cables-many-top
# the drawer is the bottom strip of the window: one point inside it at 1366x768, one at 1920x1080
try scroll 700 668 -3000
try scroll 700 980 -3000
wait 6
expect "No cables yet. Accept the proposed ones"
# no check_layout here: rows scrolled out of view are still in the widget tree and count as overlapping the tabs
shot cables-many-end
open qa/fixtures/cable-proposals-few.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+4
wait 10
expect "Proposed cables"
expect "No cables yet. Accept the proposed ones"
shot cables-few
check_layout
open qa/fixtures/cable-proposals-none.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+4
wait 10
expect_not "Proposed cables"
expect "No cables yet. Wires between two locations"
shot cables-none
check_layout
